abstract: "Paired whole-grain and ground-sample near-infrared spectra and reference chemistry for 98 independently coded sorghum samples, with reproducible model code, frozen repeated nested cross-validation results, retrospective selective-grinding analyses, and source data and programs for three figures. This journal-independent repository package preserves the numerical data and historical run receipts. Its evidence is internal validation of the development dataset and retrospective routing analysis."
keywords:
  - sorghum
  - near-infrared spectroscopy
  - grain grinding
  - nested cross-validation
  - reproducible analysis
